  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Glass, stone, and smoke appear in the same morning scene. A group of people reads a note and speaks of <rs type="keyword" ref="#religious-critique">criticism</rs>, doubt, and public reason.</p>
      <p>One voice claims that truth rises from careful study, while another prefers simple speech and familiar examples. The room remains active, restless, and alert, and the talk turns to <rs type="keyword" ref="#atheism-and-science">evidence</rs>.</p>
      <p>There is a lane outside, a market signal, and the ordinary noise of a city before noon. This is enough to carry the argument. <rs type="keyword" ref="#secular-humanism">Shared life</rs> becomes the final image. <gap></gap></p>
    </body>
  </text>
